This project interfaces with the DirectX Shader Compiler (DXC) as an external binary tool.

## DirectX Shader Compiler (DXC)

**Copyright:** Microsoft Corporation and LLVM Project Contributors
**Repository:** https://github.com/microsoft/DirectXShaderCompiler
**License:** Multiple licenses (LLVM, MIT, Microsoft)

DXC is obtained separately from:
- GitHub Releases: https://github.com/microsoft/DirectXShaderCompiler/releases
- Vulkan SDK: https://vulkan.lunarg.com/
- Windows SDK: https://developer.microsoft.com/en-us/windows/downloads/windows-sdk/

When redistributing, include DXC's original license files with the DXC binaries.

### Important Notes

1. **External Binary Only**
   - DXC is NOT included in this repository
   - Must be obtained separately
   - Invoked as external process via syscalls

2. **No Code Integration**
   - No DXC source code is compiled into this project
   - No linking against DXC libraries
   - Minimal wrapper code (< 200 lines)

3. **Licensing Isolation**
   - DXC licenses do NOT affect DXGOC license
   - Each component maintains separate license
   - Users comply with both licenses independently

