## How DXC is Used

```
Your Application
    ↓
DXGOC (MIT licensed)
    ├─ FFI System (pure Go, direct syscalls)
    └─ COM Interface to dxcompiler.dll
        ↓
    Direct DLL Call
        ↓
    dxcompiler.dll (Microsoft + LLVM licenses)
        ↓
    DXIL Bytecode
```

DXGOC calls DXC DLLs directly via pure Go FFI - no subprocess, no external process.

